From 03f92430548bf0a50730d9aeb01f8a9f6ce25a72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 08:52:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] add the MIT licence to the project root

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/willmcgugan/textual-speedups/commit/5f01ad052564ca1ac14ecf33a69c6d39be17a8af]

The v0.2.1 tree carries no licence file, so the published wheels ship no
licence text at all even though the project is MIT. Upstream added
LICENSE to main on 2026-04-08, after v0.2.1 was released; this is that
file, carried until a release includes it.

Adding the file is enough on its own: maturin's default license-files
glob (LICEN[CS]E*) picks it up, so it lands in the wheel's
dist-info/licenses/ with no packaging change.

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 LICENSE | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 LICENSE

diff --git a/LICENSE b/LICENSE
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..631eefd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/LICENSE
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+MIT License
